# Planning / handoff / one-off docs - local only, not for the public repo. Also the
# AI-assistant config (CLAUDE.md), the release runbook (folded into CONTRIBUTING + the
# release skill), the archived legacy source, and one-off technique/release notes. These
# are kept on disk but never tracked. NOTE: gitignore does not untrack an already-committed
# file - use `git rm --cached` once to drop it, after which this keeps it out.
PLAN-*.md
HANDOFF-*.md
RELEASE_NOTES_v*.md
CLAUDE.md
RELEASING.md
docs/IMAGE_EXTRACTION_TECHNIQUES.md
/archive/
/docs/archive/
